# Key Features - Nutrition Assistant

The Nutrition Assistant application offers a core suite of functional features designed to streamline personalized nutrition tracking:

1. User Authentication & Profile Security
   - Secure account registration and login architecture powered by JSON Web Tokens (JWT) and bcrypt password hashing.
   - Profile setup requiring baseline physical metrics (Age, Gender, Height, Weight, and physical Activity Level).

2. Automated BMR & Calorie Target Calculators
   - Real-time processing scripts that take user metrics to instantly calculate Basal Metabolic Rate (BMR) and daily maintenance/target caloric ceilings.
   - Automatic breakdown of critical macronutrient balances tracking precise gram distributions for Carbs, Proteins, and Fats.

3. Chronic Meal & Nutrition Logs
   - Interactive tracking interfaces where users can log daily meal item consumption.
   - MongoDB historical collection indexing to save past entries and view progressive dietary patterns over dates.

4. Dynamic Dietary Suggestions
   - Automated rule engines that scan physical conditions and target milestones to output tailored list recommendations of optimal food types and ingredient items.
